{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["כִּי צָחַקְתְּ — Rather, אַתְּ צָחַקְתְּ. Most instances of כי followed by לא are expounded only as אלא, for כי serves in four senses: אי, דילמא, אלא, דהא. And similarly: ״לֹא תִשְׁתַּחֲוֶה לֵאלֹהֵיהֶם כִּי הָרֵס תַּהֲרִיסֵם״; ״לֹא תִקְפֹּץ אֶת יָדְךָ כִּי פָתֹחַ תִּפְתַּח״ and so forth."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:29.669822840Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}